  lines:
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: "<b>Security \u25B8 Advanced</b> on SharedDocs.\n\nRead the permission
      entries and <b>disable inheritance</b> if <b>Everyone</b> still appears.\n\nAn
      inherited entry from the parent folder is the usual way a share ends up open
      to people you never granted."
